description:
The problem: Live commentators have seconds to find the right story, and one wrong stat on air costs them credibility. Top broadcasts have whole teams of researchers and producers in the commentator’s ear. Most matches have nobody.

The solution: Premier Analytics is an AI production team for every match. A team of agents watches the game live and:

cues the best talking point at each natural break;
explains why each moment matters;
answers the commentator’s questions about the match;
fact-checks what they say, as they say it.

Every number is checked against the match data before it reaches the screen.
